---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh-TW" title="首屆北美AI華樂創作大賽 2026–2027" description="由唯愛AI公益基金會、北卡浙大校友會 (ZJUAA NC) 與 北加高校聯盟 (NACUAA NorCal) 共同主辦的首屆北美AI華樂創作大賽。" path="/">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="text-center py-6 space-y-4 flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 rounded-full p-1 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 via-purple-500 to-amber-400 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-500/20 mb-2">
        <img src="/images/logo.jpg" alt="ChineseMusic.AI Logo" class="w-full h-full rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-slate-950" />
      </div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 bg-blue-950/70 text-blue-300 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border border-blue-500/30 shadow-inner">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full animate-ping"></span>
        <span>全新原創歌曲音樂盛典 · 僅限原創作品，嚴禁翻唱 · 致敬浙大130週年華誕</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mt-2">
        首屆北美AI華樂<br><span class="ai-gradient">創作大賽 2026–2027</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        面向全北美全體音樂人與創作者開放（不限族裔），以中華音樂文化（華樂）為靈感風格。<strong>僅限全新原創音樂與歌曲創作，嚴禁翻唱現有歌曲</strong>。
      </p>
      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-2 border border-purple-400/50">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-lg"></i>
          <span>唯愛AI音樂學苑官網 (music.weiai.ai)</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh-TW/register" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-500 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-blue-400 text-white font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30 hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i>
          <span>線上報名表 / Register Now</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://youtu.be/KE3NJB6791Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-red-600/30 hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube text-lg"></i>
          <span>啟動會完整影片回放</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#docs" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 font-semibold transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-emerald-400"></i>
          <span>下載賽事白皮書</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Image Banner -->
    <div class="relative w-full h-56 md:h-80 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center group">
      <img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="AI Music Banner" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.01]" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Section -->
    <div id="details" class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-6">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Details -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-10">
        
        <!-- 大賽宗旨 -->
        <section class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 shrink-0 shadow-sm">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye text-lg"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white">
              大賽宗旨 / About the Contest
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
            本大賽由 <span class="badge-blue">唯愛AI公益基金會 (VI AI for Good)</span>、<span class="badge-indigo">北卡浙大校友會 (ZJUAA NC)</span> 與 <span class="badge-purple">北加高校聯盟 (NACUAA NorCal)</span> 共同主辦，聯合田納西、費城、羅德島、佛羅里達等浙大校友會，以及北美高校聯盟北加州、矽谷、南加州、北卡、華盛頓DC分會等機構共同支持。
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
            這是<strong class="text-sky-400 font-bold">首屆北美AI華樂創作大賽</strong>。大賽以北美為主賽場，並試點開放華語世界與國際開放兩條附加賽道。熱忱歡迎全球音樂人、高校師生、學者及科技藝術愛好者踴躍參與（資格按主要居住地劃分，不限族裔），以中華音樂文化（華樂）為靈感風格。<strong class="text-amber-300">本大賽僅限全新原創音樂與歌曲創作，嚴禁翻唱現有歌曲</strong>。
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
            大賽特設<span class="badge-gold">“母校主題特別獎”</span>，鼓勵海內外校友與朋友創作獻給浙江大學130週年華誕的音樂與創意作品。
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 📢 最新動態與重要通知 / News & Announcements -->
        <section id="news" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/40 via-slate-900/90 to-purple-950/40 border border-blue-900/40 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 shrink-0 shadow-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-lg"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white">
                  最新動態與重要通知 / Announcements
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">實時追蹤大賽最新賽況、官方簡報與重要通知</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
                        <!-- Announcement Card: Workshop and Seminar Replay -->
            <div class="p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-indigo-950/80 to-slate-900 border-2 border-cyan-500/50 space-y-4 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
              <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/30 to-blue-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-bold border border-cyan-500/50 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-video"></i> 官方錄像與課件開源 · 附 9 張精選回顧
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-cyan-300/80 font-mono font-semibold">2026年9月14日 发布</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span>【全套資料上線】首屆AI音樂大賽實戰工作坊 & 唯愛AI音樂學苑第一講</span>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30 font-normal">RSI 与 创造循环</span>
              </h3>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>
                  感谢北卡浙大校友会、北加高校联盟、唯爱AI公益基金会的联合呈现！9月12日举办的两场重磅 AI 音乐讲座现已全面开源分享。
                </p>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  <div class="bg-slate-950/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="text-cyan-300 font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-400 mr-1"></i> 中午场：AI音乐实战工作坊</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">告别“碰运气盲抽”：揭秘 60 分钟速成与可改小样的“四个把手”。</p>
                    <a href="https://youtu.be/BK4CRvXjYiE" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold inline-block mt-1">👉 观看工作坊录像</a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-slate-950/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="text-cyan-300 font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-purple-400 mr-1"></i> 晚间场：学苑第一讲 (RSI)</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">深度拆解大模型与智能体的 RSI 三层架构与奖励黑客防范！</p>
                    <a href="https://youtu.be/LFpx77KGg3g" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold inline-block mt-1">👉 观看第一讲录像</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-2">
                  <a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/40 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap mr-1"></i> 唯愛AI音樂學苑官網</a>
                  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGkKw_qoWmuo" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 border border-red-500/40 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-red-500/30 transition-colors"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube mr-1"></i> 大赛官方 Playlist</a>
                  <a href="https://github.com/tracyli009/AI-music-seminar/blob/main/2026-09-12-weiai_music_seminar1.md" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors"><i class="fa-brands fa-github mr-1"></i> Tracy Li 精选讲座笔记</a>
                  <a href="https://zju.fyi/materials" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/40 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-indigo-500/30 transition-colors"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf mr-1"></i> 双镜像课件下载区</a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60">
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-3 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">讲座精选高光组图 (9张)</p>
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4">
                    <img src="/images/moment_01_concert_hall.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_02_studio_creator.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_03_cyber_guzheng.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_04_rsi_neural_loop.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_05_agent_conductor.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_06_cyber_pipa.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_07_four_handles_synth.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_08_code_notes_workspace.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                    <img src="/images/moment_09_midautumn_music_fest.jpg" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Announcement Card: 作品提交截止延期通知 -->
            <div class="p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/90 via-indigo-950/80 to-purple-950/90 border-2 border-amber-400/80 space-y-3 hover:border-amber-300 transition-all shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
              <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold border border-amber-500/50 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> 重大官方通知 · Deadline Extension
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-amber-300/80 font-mono font-semibold">2026年9月13日 發布</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span>【延期通知】全賽道作品提交統一順延至 9月28日（農曆八月十八週一）</span>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 font-normal">充裕靈感 · 智慧預審加速</span>
              </h3>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
                <p>
                  應廣大參賽者與音樂創作者的熱切建議，為了讓大家擁有更寬裕的時間精心打磨作品品質、雕琢AI編曲與詞曲細節，並充分利用接下來的週末黃金時間全身心投入創作；同時恰逢中華傳統中秋佳節臨近，組委會鼓勵大家在中秋月圓、親朋匯聚的美好節日氛圍中汲取更多中華傳統文化與人文情感的藝術靈感，揮灑才情！
                </p>
                <p>
                  與此同時，大賽技術團隊已對底層<strong>「AI智能體自動化合規與智慧輔助評審系統」</strong>完成重磅架構升級。升級後的AI評審智能體能夠以更高效率全天候完成多模態音頻與版權初篩、自動化格式校驗及聲學多維輔助解析，大幅壓縮了初審週期，不需要冗長的等待時間。
                </p>
                <p class="bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl p-3 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-200 font-medium">
                  🌟 <strong>最新日程調整</strong>：北美主賽道、華語世界賽道、國際開放賽道及浙大130週年母校特別獎全賽道作品提交截止時間統一順延至：<br>
                  <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm md:text-base">👉 2026年9月28日（農曆八月十八，週一）11:59 PM EDT / 8:59 PM PDT</span><br>
                  <span class="text-slate-300 text-xs mt-1 inline-block">初賽晉級結果與短名單揭曉無縫銜接，將於 <strong>9月30日（週三）</strong> 統一公布，賽程整體推進高效有序。</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/zh-TW/register" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-400 text-slate-950 text-xs font-bold shadow-md transition-all">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen text-[11px]"></i> 抓緊創作 · 立即報名提交
                </a>
                <a href="#dates" class="text-xs text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days"></i> 查看更新後的重要時間表 →
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Announcement Card: 新增試點賽道 -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/80 via-slate-950/90 to-purple-950/80 border border-amber-500/50 space-y-2 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all shadow-lg">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold border border-amber-500/40">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn mr-1"></i> 新增賽道公告 · Pilot Tracks
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">2026年9月</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-white">
                【新增賽道】華語世界 + 國際開放試點開放（限額 150 / 80）
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                為回應北美以外創作者的熱切參與意願，本屆在「首屆北美AI華樂創作大賽」主品牌下，試點增設：
                <br>• <strong>華語世界賽道（Sinophone Track · 試點限額 150 件）</strong>
                <br>• <strong>國際開放賽道（International Open Track · 試點限額 80 件）</strong>
                <br>主賽事名稱不變。全賽道統一順延截止時間為 <strong>2026年9月28日（農曆八月十八週一）11:59 PM EDT</strong>。
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/zh-TW/register" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md transition-all">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen text-[10px]"></i> 立即線上報名
                </a>
                <a href="#eligibility" class="text-xs text-blue-400 hover:underline">查看賽道資格規則 →</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- News Item 1 -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-blue-900/50 space-y-2 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-900/60 text-blue-300 text-xs font-bold border border-blue-700/40">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles mr-1"></i> 最新發布
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">2026年8月28日</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">
                【啟動會圓滿舉行】首屆北美華人AI音樂大賽官方啟動會召開，2部現場錄影與3部Gemini研討影片發布
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                2026年8月28日美西1:00 PM，大賽線上啟動與創作交流會順利舉行。組委會正式發布官方簡報與白皮書，並上線 2 部原版現場影片及 3 部基於 Google Gemini NotebookLM 生成的深度研討影片！
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs">
                <a href="https://youtu.be/KE3NJB6791Y" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300 font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                  <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i> 觀看啟動會完整回放
                </a>
                <span class="text-slate-600">·</span>
                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGkKw_qoWmuo" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300 font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-list"></i> YouTube 5部合集播放列表
                </a>
                <span class="text-slate-600">·</span>
                <a href="#docs" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down"></i> 下載官方白皮書
                </a>
              </div>
